      "pass_anchor": "For DPC-2025Q3-0064, the two observations are invoice INV-AP-250829-3318 and payment INV-AP-250829-3318-C for supplier SUP-01904, Pacific Campus Catering Co.; both use normalized content hash sha256:ee3318 and bank-account hash ba:8801, with payment references PAY-25-0911-3318 and PAY-25-0918-3318C, and gross payment 1,123,456 cents each. The existing note says exact invoice number match remains pending vendor statement confirmation. The response must state that these matching signals warrant review but, without vendor-statement confirmation and without a recovery observation, they do not by themselves prove a confirmed duplicate."
